+# hash joins. An intentionally unselected operator input makes its existing next
+# gate terminate before source composition, output creation, signing or Cargo.
+# Reaching that exact rejection proves the original controller-only composition
+# passed the same admission path that previously rejected the actual APK build.
+Push-Location $RepoRoot
